      quoteChecklist: ["Provide the number of windows and the room names.", "Send safe indoor photographs with each window open and closed.", "State the concern: children, birds, pets or another specific issue.", "Include approximate opening dimensions, floor level and frame type if known.", "Describe existing grills, exhausts, cleaning needs and planned window replacement."],
