        "The general term covers different products and layouts. Ask what is proposed for your opening and the evidence supporting its intended application. A cable's advertised breaking load does not establish the performance of the completed installation. Nor does a slim cable barrier automatically provide burglary resistance, insect screening or bird exclusion. Each additional requirement needs its own consideration.",
