          "If a coated cable is offered, clarify which diameter is being stated and what care the coating requires. A larger advertised dimension does not by itself demonstrate a better installation. For a coastal or exposed opening, ask how the proposed components suit the actual environment and how they will be inspected. Avoid treating stainless steel as a promise that no maintenance will ever be needed.",
