          "Vertical and horizontal layouts also create different visual patterns and potential climbing opportunities. Ask the installer to explain the proposed arrangement and any intermediate supports, especially across a broad opening. Lines should make sense with the window or balcony geometry. A drawing can show track positions and junctions more clearly than a photograph of an unrelated completed job.",
