      "For openings facing the sea around Neelankarai, Kottivakkam or Besant Nagar, discuss the actual exposure and maintenance access. Stainless steel selection should account for environmental conditions rather than an assumption that every Chennai address is identical. Ask how the complete set of metal components has been considered, including less visible fittings.",
