      "For duplex homes in Porur, Tambaram or Anna Nagar, include the upper landing as well as the main staircase in photographs. A single staircase can combine wood finishes, metal rails and open voids. The assessment should reflect that mix and the family's actual use of upstairs rooms, rather than assuming a uniform panel along one flight.",
